{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"de49a4b9849b6040ecd879e05fa1cd8d7d012737a64e8363d00e1b9ee1527cf5","ja":"（歴史の本……すごく難しそう。\nけど、本をめくる貴音さん、上品で絵になるな……）","zh":"（历史书……看起来好难。\n不过，翻着书的贵音，动作真高雅，简直像一幅画啊……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"52bc675bfe35c791ef4facc8b39661b85925502af6358d951aef84ee8f1e993a","ja":"あとは、こちらの雑誌も忘れずに♪","zh":"还有，也别忘了这本杂志哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9826335418995d88d9c87b282776453a1a33999288dad78c6fa5e06867824c56","ja":"（「都内のラーメン店ランキング、今冬決定版！」\n……ふふ、貴音さんらしいな）","zh":"（“东京都内拉面店排行榜，今冬最终版！”\n……呵呵，真像贵音的作风啊）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d37bc4cc2f14ad844b46a53913f48e83aea66cef870b1a291e445292542a0b0b","ja":"やはり冬はらーめん業界も盛り上がりますね……\nふふ♪","zh":"果然冬天拉面行业也会热闹起来呢……\n呵呵♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8aa91b34fb170cf399f8434ed2b4f67ec8c9ae5699488a31a0ecadf39c31b211","ja":"（あれ！？　ラーメンの雑誌も、貴音さんが持つと\n優雅な感じに……！　本のジャンルは関係ない！？）","zh":"（咦！？　连拉面杂志只要被贵音拿着，\n感觉都会变得很优雅……！难道跟书的题材无关吗！？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d19a64d8b031b2baa3e6e4ab73bd3b3fcd5955c7aad9ee5a325ceb465d22b074","ja":"それでは、この二冊を購入してまいります。\nところで……。","zh":"那么，我去买下这两本书了。\n话说回来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c94d8acd69cd54b8071e9b3affb80e98c1a768368eb57ab25bc45f62b8dea095","ja":"私は静香の参考になったのでしょうか？\nいつも通りにしていただけなのですが。","zh":"我真的有给静香起到参考作用吗？\n我只是像平时那样做而已。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"449bd608070541ba1dfeace29c5e70824660af4f0c7c26dde34bfc1398fc2885","ja":"はい、とっても！","zh":"是的，非常棒！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"099f4d0b741c3004c1399294f379ca56ed6643fec5843154c65808b3da8ca4c8","ja":"それは真、よかったです。ちなみに、これから食事に\n行こうと思うのですが、静香も一緒にいかがでしょう。","zh":"那真是太好了。顺便问一下，我正打算去\n吃顿饭，静香要不要也一起来呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1712.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"10501a7581aae0f3f6034952e25bddd85cbd2a85ed75f9e10ded9b9bfd87bf0e","ja":"いいんですか？　ぜひお願いします！","zh":"真的可以吗？那就拜托了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
